cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the JGR paper."
title: "dvv-workflow: An operational pipeline for interpreting seismic velocity changes as stress and strain meters"
abstract: >
  dvv-workflow implements the six-phase operational workflow of Denolle (in
  prep, JGR Solid Earth) for interpreting relative seismic velocity changes
  (delta v / v) as coupled stress and strain meters. Given a delta v / v
  time series and the relevant environmental forcings, the package extracts
  depth-resolved stress estimates with propagated uncertainties, water-table
  inversions, coupling-tier diagnostics, and anomaly classifications.
authors:
